<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Serfin opens Acla with buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Serfin opens Acla with buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>- Grupo Financiero Serfin said on Friday it has initiated coverage of Acer Computec Latinoameria (Acla) with a buy recommendation because of the company's expected expanded participation in Latin American countries.</p>
</text>
